    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII-style connection management for transaction operations. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>1.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>This module provides exception-safe connection lifecycle management</para>
</simplesect>
This header defines RAII wrappers and guards for database connection management in the transaction module. All connections acquired through these guards are guaranteed to be released, even in the presence of exceptions.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>storage/database_connection_manager.h <ref refid="bench__transaction__phase4_8cpp_1ad6a7b6b73caa2bc27f897bd23d8740ec" kindref="member">for</ref> underlying connection pool </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
